vector<int> G[100009], H[100009]; int root = 1, parent[17][100009], depth[100009], n, m, s[100009], t[100009], r[100009];
pair<int, int>L[100009]; int smax[100009], tmax[100009];
void dfs(int v, int p, int d) {
	parent[0][v] = p; depth[v] = d;
	for (int i : G[v]) if (i != p) dfs(i, v, d + 1);
}
void init(int v) {
	dfs(root, -1, 0);
	for (int i = 0; i < 16; i++) {
		for (int j = 0; j < v; j++) {
			if (parent[i][j] < 0) parent[i + 1][j] = -1;
			else parent[i + 1][j] = parent[i][parent[i][j]];
		}
	}
}
void makeH() {
	for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) { L[i] = make_pair(depth[i], i); }
	for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
		for (int j = 0; j < G[i].size(); j++) {
			if (depth[i] < depth[G[i][j]])H[i].push_back(G[i][j]);
		}
	}
	sort(L + 1, L + n + 1);
}
int query(int v1, int v2) {
	if (depth[v1] > depth[v2]) swap(v1, v2);
	for (int i = 0; i < 17; i++) {
		if ((depth[v2] - depth[v1]) >> i & 1) v2 = parent[i][v2];
	}
	if (v1 == v2) return v1;
	for (int i = 16; i >= 0; i--) {
		if (parent[i][v1] != parent[i][v2]) {
			v1 = parent[i][v1];
			v2 = parent[i][v2];
		}
	}
	return parent[0][v1];
}
void rec(int p) {
	if (r[p] != -1) {
		s[p] = r[p] + depth[p];
		t[p] = r[p] - depth[p];
	}
	else {
		for (int i = 0; i < H[p].size(); i++) {
			rec(H[p][i]);
			s[p] = min(s[p], s[H[p][i]]);
			t[p] = max(t[p], t[H[p][i]]);
		}
	}
}
int main() {
	for (int i = 0; i < 100009; i++) { r[i] = -1; }
	cin >> n; for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++) { int a, b; cin >> a >> b; G[a].push_back(b); G[b].push_back(a); }
	init(n); cin >> m; int KG = -1; makeH();
	for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {
		int a, b; cin >> a >> b; r[a] = b;
		if (KG == -1)KG = (1000000 + r[a] - depth[a]) % 2;
		else if (KG != (1000000 + r[a] - depth[a]) % 2) { cout << "No" << endl; return 0; }
	}
	fill(s, s + n + 1, 999999999);
	fill(t, t + n + 1, -999999999);
	rec(root);

	for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
		int minn = 999999999;
		vector<pair<int, int> >w1, w2;
		if (H[i].size() <= 1)continue;
		for (int j = 0; j < H[i].size(); j++) {
			w1.push_back(make_pair(s[H[i][j]], j));
			w2.push_back(make_pair(t[H[i][j]], j));
		}
		sort(w1.begin(), w1.end());
		sort(w2.begin(), w2.end(), greater<pair<int, int> >());
		if (w1[0].second != w2[0].second) minn = min(minn, w1[0].first - w2[0].first);
		if (w1[0].second != w2[1].second) minn = min(minn, w1[0].first - w2[1].first);
		if (w1[1].second != w2[0].second) minn = min(minn, w1[1].first - w2[0].first);
		if (minn < depth[i] * 2) { cout << "No" << endl; return 0; }
	}
	cout << "Yes" << endl;
	return 0;
}

